to kill him, but with AC -51 (All armor +4/5 and Fort Ludios)
he didn't do much damage at all. Only 40 hp or so, which
was much compared to what other monsters did.

I didn't even use my wand of wishing, and had all intrinsics, 2 AoLS,
+6 Vorpal Blade/ +6 Magic Bane, 2 RoTC, 2 AoR, 2 SoR, without
abuses. Just zap those wands of create monster and pick up
all those wands of create monster that appear.

Due to polypyle-abuse (is it still an abuse?) I had spells for [a-z A-G]
I only missed spellbook of genocide. But with 3 Magic Markers found,
I was able to creater enough myself. Further encountered:
3 luckstones, 3 bag of holdings (but I whised for one early in the game),
Gray Dragons (genocided D at the end, after V/L/h/gremlins/cockatrices)

I used to have a luckstone and a unicorn horn in my BoH, so when my
normals get cursed, I have a spare one. Together with those 40 holy water
and 40 Scrolls, I was able to face everthing I know of.

This game ended with a dungeon colaps, and after recovering death by
trickery :-( The game-administrator was so kind to enter my name
